{
  "title": "Synthesis and magneto-structural studies on a new family of carbonato bridged 3d–4f complexes featuring a [Co3IILn3III(CO3)] (Ln = La, Gd, Tb, Dy and Ho) core: slow magnetic relaxation displayed by the cobalt(II)–dysprosium(III) analogue",
