        "yield": "70 mg (67%)"
      },
      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "both",
        "summary": "DC susceptibility of the Co3La3 cluster is consistent with three high-spin Co(II) ions and weak antiferromagnetic coupling (χMT falls from 6.41 cm3 K mol−1 at RT to 3.20 at 2 K; Weiss θ = −1.92 K). Magnetization at 2 K/5 T is only 2.10 μB. UV–vis absorption bands of the magenta complex were recorded in CH2Cl2.",
